{
  "_name": "s36_reprovision_purges_carriers",
  "_desc": "REPROVISION purges every staged/in-flight TX carrier (2026-07-27, \u00a7clean-join-carriers). Derived from s19. Node A stages ALL FIVE carriers, then `leave` runs the console-provisioning reprovision (reset_join_for_reprovision -> clear_routing_state -> purge_tx_carriers(PurgeAxis::reprovision)). \u2605 WHY THIS SCENARIO EXISTS: that whole path was provably unreachable from the sim -- an unconditional tracer measured 0 entries in 1.86 M corpus events, for clear_routing_state() ENTIRELY, not just the carrier sweep. Native tests were its only detector until the sim gained a `leave` verb. \u2605 THE LEAK IT PINS, observed in a poisoned build: without the purge the surviving m_broadcast flight RE-AIRS the channel payload AFTER the reprovision (TX DATA ...6368616e2d636f6e74656e74 = 'chan-content'), now stamped with the NEW leaf_id and src=0, and the three surviving queue items churn no_route -> send_deferred_giveup. \u26a0 ASSERT ORDERING IS LOAD-BEARING: cmd_reply_contains matches `command` as a PREFIX and takes the most-recent match, so \"leave\" also matches \"leave 3\" -- the malformed C2 probe MUST fire before the real leave or assert 1 silently reads the ERROR reply. \u26a0 Asserts 1-2 pin the transport only and pass in a poisoned build; 3-4 are the durable mechanism pins and 5-7 are behavioural (measured poisoned: 658 ms/6 frames aired, data_tx 2, send_deferred_giveup 3).",
  "simulation": {
    "duration_ms": 1200000,
    "step_ms": 1,
    "warmup_ms": 0,
    "beacon_period_ms": 60000,
    "seed": 42,
    "node_startup_jitter_ms": 5000,
    "radio": {
      "sf": 8,
      "bw": 125,
      "cr": 5,
      "max_packet_bytes": 255,
      "snr_coherence_ms": 0,
      "duty_cycle": 10
    }
  },
  "config": {
    "debug_start_ms": 0,
    "debug_end_ms": 1200000
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "_c": "warm _rt/_id_bind so clear_routing_state has real state to drop",
      "at_ms": 300000,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "send B p1 warm"
    },
    {
      "_c": "C2 pin \u2014 MUST precede the real `leave` (cmd_reply_contains is prefix+most-recent)",
      "at_ms": 500000,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "leave 3"
    },
    {
      "_c": "stages _channel_buffer row + _channel_reoffer_pending slot + an m_broadcast _pending_tx flight",
      "at_ms": 600000,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "send_channel 7 chan-content"
    },
    {
      "_c": "three _tx_queue items queued behind the flight",
      "at_ms": 600000,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "send B p1 stage1"
    },
    {
      "at_ms": 600000,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "send B p1 stage2"
    },
    {
      "at_ms": 600000,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "send B p1 stage3"
    },
    {
      "_c": "\u2605 THE VERB: reprovision -> purge_tx_carriers(PurgeAxis::reprovision)",
      "at_ms": 600002,
      "node": "A",
      "command": "leave"
    }
  ],
